<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n83607" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πλᾰτύ-σημος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			(<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σῆμα</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>with broad border,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. χιτών,</span>
			= Lat. <i>tunica laticlavia,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				D.S.
				36.7
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Str.
				3.5.1
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡ π. ἐσθής</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdn.
					3.11.2
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">συι θέσεις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>PHamb.</u>
					10.15
				</span></i>
			
			<span class="entity">(ii A.D.)</span>: abs., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡ π.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arr.
					<u>Epict.</u>
					1.24.12
				</span></i>
			; cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">στενόσημος.</span>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> of those entitled to wear
			it, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χιλίαρχος π.,</span>
			=
			<i>tribunus laticlavius,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				IG
				4.588.4
			</span></i> (Argos, <span class="entity">ii A.D.</span>), <i><span class="en">
				<u>IGRom.</u>
				3.554
			</span></i> (<span class="entity">Tlos</span>), <i><span class="en">
				889
			</span></i> (<span class="entity">Adana</span>).</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
